#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:257
msgid ""
"Legends have the same properties related to their background rectangular "
"panel and also have the properties related to the font in which the name of "
"each series will be added to the legend, the font type, style, and size."
msgstr ""
"Förklaringar har samma egenskaper för bakgrundsrutans utseende. De har också"
" inställningar för typsnitt, stil och storlek på texten med namnet på varje "
"dataserie."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:272
msgid ""
"Grids are the background of Cartesian plots and have the properties "
"determining the fill of this area and the line pattern displayed behind the "
"plotted series."
msgstr ""
"Rutnät utgör bakgrunden i kartesiska diagram och har inställningar för "
"områdets fyllning och linjemönstret som visas bakom dataserierna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:296
msgid ""
"The properties of each type of plot, and of the data series they contain, "
"vary depending on the actual type of the plot. For instance, the values of a"
" data series which are plotted as a pie plot will not have any associated "
"error values, whereas values plotted as columns could be associated to "
"Y-error values and values plotted as an XY scatterplot could be associated "
"with error values in both the X and the Y direction. Obviously, these "
"different plot types will require different options. The options associated "
"with each specific plot type will be discussed below, in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Egenskaperna för varje diagramtyp och dess dataserier beror på diagramtypen."
" Värden i ett cirkeldiagram har till exempel inga tillhörande felvärden, "
"medan kolumner kan ha Y-felvärden och ett XY-spridningsdiagram kan ha "
"felvärden i både X- och Y-led. De olika diagramtyperna kräver därför olika "
"alternativ. Alternativen för varje typ beskrivs nedan i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:319
msgid "The Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:321
msgid ""
"All graphs in <application>Gnumeric</application> are created using the "
"<interface>Graph Guru</interface> which is a complex dialog that allows for "
"detailed customization of each graph."
msgstr ""
"Alla grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> skapas med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, en avancerad dialogruta där du kan "
"anpassa varje graf i detalj."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:330
msgid "The components of the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguidens delar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:332
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> consists of two panels which appear "
"sequentially. The first panel allows the user to select the type of the "
"plot, and possibly a sub-type and a style. The second panel provides a way "
"to configure the style formats of each component of the final graph. <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/> shows the different areas of the two "
"panels of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> består av två paneler som visas i tur "
"och ordning. I den första väljer du diagramtyp och eventuellt undertyp och "
"stil. I den andra kan du ställa in utseendet på varje del i den färdiga "
"grafen. <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/> visar de olika områdena i "
"de två panelerna i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:343
msgid "The two panels of the Graph Guru"
msgstr "Diagramguidens två paneler"
